{"id":"4e50c115b0d32044","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-consistency-predicate.md","title":"标准有限证明的一致性句与元层一致性","display":"df-consistency-predicate — 标准有限证明的一致性句与元层一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-consistency-predicate","aliases":["91-df-consistency-predicate"],"display":"df-consistency-predicate — 标准有限证明的一致性句与元层一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-consistency-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-consistency-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-predicate — 标准有限证明的一致性句与元层一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为给定有效公理枚举和有限可检验规则的演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=(0=1)\">\\(\\bot=(0=1)\\)</span> 为固定矛盾句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a)\\)</span> 验证一棵标准有限证明树；公理叶包含其枚举阶段及计算证书，使此验证关系为 PR。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S,\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S,\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span> 为对象算术缩写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 为元层性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(a)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(a)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Prf}_S(\\overline p,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Prf}_S(\\overline p,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可递归公理化只给可枚举公理时，直接判断叶是否公理未必是 PR；须给叶附枚举证书，或先使用一个已明确的 PR 公理谓词。现列出这个有限证明数据约定。\n对象句 Con(S)、元层确实一致、B 中可证 Con(S)、B 中可证相对一致性蕴涵为不同层级。单个 ¬T(⌜⊥⌝) 只说矛盾不真，不等于没有 S 的矛盾证明。\n第二不完备定理还要固定自然可证性谓词和通常推导条件，不能对任意名称类似的 Rosser 或改造谓词无条件套用。</p>\n<p>来源：§5 的证明编码；§8.6 关于自然可证性与 Rosser 可证性的讨论，印刷页 90–94。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=(0=1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S,\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(a)\\coloneqq\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,a),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Prf}_S(\\overline p,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Con}(S).","display":true}],"bytes":1918,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"656104419469b4d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"846676177c8a9727","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0815358d5b1d8115","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"14209f87e5536e32","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"954547d789193344","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4fb5cfb29c2f255e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":